  "question": {
    "text": "Let $P$ be the point $(1,0)$ and $Q$ a point on the locus $y^2=8 x$. The locus of mid point of $P Q$ is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "Mx6qE",
      "text": "\n$y^2-4 x+2=0$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "f8xgp",
      "text": "\n$y^2+4 x+2=0$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "0rfUe",
      "text": "\n$x^2+4 y+2=0$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MpWFx",
      "text": "\n$x^2-4 y+2=0$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{P}=(1,0)$\n$Q=(h, k)$ such that $k^2=8 h$\nLet $(\\alpha, \\beta)$ be the midpoint of PQ\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\alpha=\\frac{\\mathrm{h}+1}{2}, \\quad \\beta=\\frac{\\mathrm{k}+0}{2} \\\\\n& 2 \\alpha-1=\\mathrm{h}, \\quad 2 \\beta=\\mathrm{k} . \\\\\n& (2 \\beta)^2=8(2 \\alpha-1) \\Rightarrow \\beta^2=4 \\alpha-2 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{y}^2-4 \\mathrm{x}+2=0 .\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
